                <pb facs="0084" n="28" xml:id="pg28"/>

                <head>No. 24.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Princess Imperial,
                            Regent of Brazil, to the President</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 4, 1876</date>.
                        (Received July 4.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Princess Imperial, Regent of Brazil, congratulates herself and the President
                    of the United States of America on the occasion of the centenary of the
                    independence of those States, for whose prosperity she offers sincere
                    prayers.</p>
                <closer>THE PRINCESS IMPERIAL, REGENT.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
